		<Tag>TXT_KEY_LEADER_TAMAR_03_PEDIA</Tag>
		<English>[TAB]Atossa (c. 550-475 BC, Persia) - An Achaemenid queen, daughter of Cyrus the Great, wife of Darius I, mother of Xerxes I, and politically influential at court, especially in helping legitimize Darius' rule through her Cyrus-lineage and in supporting Xerxes' succession.</English>
